---
kind: lore
id: south.stoneGymHall
title: Stone Gym — trainers, guide, and Petra after the battle
---

// The gym trainers answer trainerSpotted inside the Stone Gym.

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="stoneGymHikerBo" who="stoneGymHikerBo" intro="Stop right there! You're a light-years away from facing Petra!" win="Light-years measure distance, not time. I knew that." lose="Light-years, I said!" prize="200" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="southStoneGymHikerBoAfter" on="talk" target="npc.stoneGymHikerBo" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['stoneGymHikerBo'])">
  @stoneGymHikerBo{code="0010"}: Petra's rocks are slow but they hit like falling cliffs. Grass and water, friend. Grass and water.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="stoneGymCamperLiam" who="stoneGymCamperLiam" intro="The gravel's raked in a pattern. You walked through the pattern. Now we battle about it." win="I'll re-rake it. It's fine. It's calming." lose="Pattern restored!" prize="220" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="southStoneGymCamperLiamAfter" on="talk" target="npc.stoneGymCamperLiam" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['stoneGymCamperLiam'])">
  @stoneGymCamperLiam{code="0010"}: Petra rakes the whole hall herself every morning. It takes two hours. She says it's the only time nobody talks to her.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="stoneGymHikerDara" who="stoneGymHikerDara" intro="I'm the last stone before the leader. Crack me if you can!" win="Cracked! Clean through!" lose="Not a scratch!" prize="240" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="southStoneGymHikerDaraAfter" on="talk" target="npc.stoneGymHikerDara" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['stoneGymHikerDara'])">
  @stoneGymHikerDara{code="0010"}: Petra doesn't smile when she loses. She doesn't smile when she wins either. She smiled once. We still talk about it.
</entry>

// ── The Gym Guide ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southStoneGuideAfter" on="talk" target="npc.stoneGymGuide" category="bark" priority="5" when="holds('hasBadge', ['stone'])">
  @stoneGymGuide{code="0010"}: You did it! I told you! Didn't I tell you? I tell everybody, so technically I told you.
</entry>

<entry id="southStoneGuide" on="talk" target="npc.stoneGymGuide" category="bark">
  @stoneGymGuide{code="0010"}: Yo! Champ in the making! Petra's rock monsters shrug off fire and fly-by attacks. Soak them or grow roots through them. Go get 'em!
</entry>

// ── Petra, after the badge ───────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southPetraMorning" on="talk" target="npc.petra" category="bark" priority="10" when="holds('defeated', ['petra']) && @isMorning">
  @petra{code="0010"}: I rake the gravel in the morning. Walk on the edges, please.
</entry>

<entry id="southPetraAfter" on="talk" target="npc.petra" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['petra'])">
  @petra{code="0010"}: Marin in Tidewell will soak you if you let her. Don't let her. Or let her, and learn to swim.
</entry>
